{
  "_comment": [
    "The Oathblade's looks and sounds, put together by localTools/ascensionImport/importVisuals.py from the retail",
    "effects and sounds the Ascension client carries: a noble fencer in blue and white, Bastion's light (the Kyrian",
    "covenant), arcane and frost blue, retail steel. Each look starts from the stock visual the spell cloned (its from,",
    "for the swing animations and Frost Strike's blue weapon trail) and replaces the slots given; every sound is retail's.",
    "localTools/oathblade/Spells.ps1 names a look by the id the import gives its key.",
    "Strikes: Swift Cut (a Kyrian strike, Crusader Strike's revamp), Precise Thrust (an arcane blast, Chaos Strike's",
    "thrust), Zeal Strike (retail Frost Strike), Noble Verdict (Bastion light in the hands and on the target, Templar's",
    "Verdict), Final Edict (Azureblade's arcane cleave, Final Verdict, a light shake), Reversal (Overpower, a parry's",
    "clash), Pommel Strike (Rebuke, Shield Bash). Areas: Sweeping Arc (retail whirlwind, Blade Dance), Crescent Sweep",
    "(an arcane ring), Blade Dance (the Windlord's blades), Grand Flourish (an arcane explosion); each carrier's hit on",
    "every enemy is silent (the ability was heard once). Noble Advance (retail charge, Fel Rush), Blade Ward (Shield",
    "Wall's ring, arcane blades while it holds, Die by the Sword), Flourish, Rally (retail battle shout), Flawless Form",
    "(a Bastion nova, the body lit and tinted blue with arcane blades, an arcane surge as it ends; Avatar's roar), its",
    "echo on every technique (an arcane blast)."
  ],
